  "narrative": {
   "northStar": "Raking light: a dark room with one warm lamp, moved low across the surface.",
   "overview": "Conservators photograph a surface with a low, moving lamp so texture shows as light and shadow. OpenGonio does that with motors and a fixed camera, so the interface is a dark room with one lamp in it.",
   "keyCharacteristics": [
    "Velvet ground, bone ink",
    "One tungsten accent: the lamp and the primary action",
    "Scale-bar patches for status, always with a word",
    "Gloock headlines, Hanken Grotesk text, tabular figures",
    "Square corners, no gradients, no resting shadows"
   ],
